    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game lntroduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After working for years, you realize your current life isn't what you desired. Under intense work pressure, you consider resigning... while longing to return to your childhood town and reunite with familiar faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, the town's drastic changes unsettle you, but kind neighbors offer support. The enthusiastic sheriff, busy mayor, and childhood friends await to reminisce with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The well-stocked supermarket and blooming flower shop remain unchanged since your youth. Oh, and don't forget the town's quirky animal pals! Bond closely with them for unexpected gifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the town's tranquility lies upheaval. Balancing economic growth with environmental protection is vital\u2014choose wisely to shape the town's destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A town bursting with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisitely drawn character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and fun easter eggs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795690/extras/53e61f249f2025241d39487b7a894ce9.avif?t=1751027706\" width=610 height=387 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introductions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795690/extras/a9ed9b8c20c3917ae2d873c5d4fa7417.avif?t=1751027706\" width=610 height=1207 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game lntroduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After working for years, you realize your current life isn't what you desired. Under intense work pressure, you consider resigning... while longing to return to your childhood town and reunite with familiar faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, the town's drastic changes unsettle you, but kind neighbors offer support. The enthusiastic sheriff, busy mayor, and childhood friends await to reminisce with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The well-stocked supermarket and blooming flower shop remain unchanged since your youth. Oh, and don't forget the town's quirky animal pals! Bond closely with them for unexpected gifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the town's tranquility lies upheaval. Balancing economic growth with environmental protection is vital\u2014choose wisely to shape the town's destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A town bursting with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisitely drawn character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and fun easter eggs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795690/extras/53e61f249f2025241d39487b7a894ce9.avif?t=1751027706\" width=610 height=387 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introductions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795690/extras/a9ed9b8c20c3917ae2d873c5d4fa7417.avif?t=1751027706\" width=610 height=1207 /></span></p>",
